<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE BRIEFING ══════════════════ -->
<h1 class="first">1. Executive Summary &amp; Strategic Alignment</h1>
<p>
  Over the past development lifecycle, the engineering and product teams were chartered with transforming AccBots from a traditional physical advisory practice into a scalable, modern <strong>FinTech and Corporate Advisory Digital Engine</strong>. We are proud to formally present to the Board of Directors the finalized, end-to-end verified <strong>AccBots Platform v1.0.0</strong>.
</p>
<p>
  The platform delivers an integrated digital ecosystem serving two corporate missions:
</p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Public Market Expansion:</strong> An ultra-fast, search-engine-optimized, premium digital presence targeting domestic (Sri Lanka) and international (UAE, GCC, Singapore) corporate clients seeking accounting, FTA tax advisory, auditing, and corporate secretarial solutions.</li>
  <li><strong>Proprietary Digital Operating Infrastructure:</strong> A high-security client self-service portal, integrated cloud expense ledger, automated double-entry general ledger, and administrative command telemetry eliminating legacy manual overhead.</li>
</ol>

<!-- Executive KPI Summary Cards -->
<table class="kpi-grid">
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 25%;">
      <div class="kpi-num">100%</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">Core Milestone Delivery</div>
    </td>
    <td style="width: 25%;">
      <div class="kpi-num">15 / 15</div>
      <div class="kpi-label">E2E Test Suites Passed</div>
    </td>
    <td style="width: 25%;">
      <div class="kpi-num">65%</div>
