    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="alert-box">
  <strong>Strategic Key Takeaway:</strong> The AccBots platform is completely independent of expensive proprietary SaaS licenses (such as third-party auth vendors or off-the-shelf CRM licensing), saving the company an estimated <strong>$18,400+ annually</strong> in recurring licensing fees while maintaining complete sovereignty over corporate financial data.
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 2: SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & DELIVERABLES ══════════════════ -->
<h1>2. Deliverables Inventory &amp; Platform Capabilities</h1>
<p>
  The AccBots platform encompasses four interconnected operational tiers developed under strict software engineering principles:
</p>

<table>
