<h2>4.2 Static Code Analysis &amp; Type Safety</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>TypeScript Compiler (`tsc --noEmit`):</strong> Verified 0 errors across 100% of application files.</li>
  <li><strong>ESLint Engine:</strong> Verified 0 blocking errors. All imports and hooks adhere to Next.js strict production standards.</li>
  <li><strong>Continuous Integration (CI):</strong> Configured automated GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/e2e.yml`) guaranteeing every future update is validated prior to deployment.</li>
</ul>

<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 5: GOVERNANCE, RISK & CYBERSECURITY ══════════════════ -->
<h1>5. Corporate Governance, Data Sovereignty &amp; Security Compliance</h1>
<p>
  Handling confidential financial statements, corporate tax filings, and receipt archives mandates bank-level security controls. AccBots implements an institutional defense-in-depth posture:
</p>

<div class="card-box-navy">
  <div class="card-box-title">Security Architecture Pillars</div>
  <table style="margin-top: 6px; border: none;">
    <tr>
      <td style="border: none; width: 33%;">
        <strong>1. Cryptographic Security</strong><br>
        Passwords hashed using industry-standard bcrypt/Argon2 with high-cost salt. Auth tokens hashed via SHA-256 in database sessions.
      </td>
      <td style="border: none; width: 33%;">
        <strong>2. Cookie &amp; Transport Defense</strong><br>
        Stateless HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax authentication cookies. Protection against Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) and CSRF exploits.
      </td>
      <td style="border: none; width: 33%;">
        <strong>3. Data Isolation &amp; RBAC</strong><br>
        Multi-tenant customer segregation. Client accounts can never read nor mutate ledger records of other commercial entities.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h2>5.1 Regulatory Compliance Mapping</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Jurisdiction / Standard</th>
      <th style="width: 45%;">Regulatory Requirement</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">AccBots Platform Implementation</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Sri Lanka IRD &amp; Companies Act</strong></td>
      <td>Audit trail retention, VAT record preservation, accurate journal balancing</td>
      <td>Immutable timestamped general ledger records with debit/credit balance enforcement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>UAE Federal Tax Authority (FTA)</strong></td>
      <td>Corporate Tax registration readiness, standard financial statements</td>
      <td>Automated Trial Balance &amp; Profit and Loss statement generator in compliance with FTA standards</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Personal Data Protection (PDPA / GDPR)</strong></td>
      <td>Right to erasure, client profile modification, secure transit</td>
      <td>Full user profile management, HTTPS/TLS 1.3 enforced end-to-end, zero data leakage</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

